IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0017.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY INT0017C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> RATE AFTER BONUS
    05 WS-BNR             PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM APPLY-BONUS
    DISPLAY "WS-BNR=" WS-BNR
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-BONUS.
    IF C-AG-YY >= 60 AND L-BL >= 5000.00
        COMPUTE WS-BNR = S-RT + 0.0025
    ELSE
        MOVE S-RT TO WS-BNR
    END-IF.
